## 💬 Commands

| Command | Permission | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `/lifesteal` or `/ls` | `nexoralifesteal.use` | Open the Lifesteal GUI |
| `/lifesteal <player>` | `nexoralifesteal.use` | Check another player's heart count |
| `/withdraw <amount>` | `nexoralifesteal.use` | Withdraw hearts as tradeable items |
| `/sethearts <player> <amount>` | `nexoralifesteal.admin` | Set a player's heart count |
| `/lifestealreload` | `nexoralifesteal.admin` | Hot-reload config.yml |

> Amount shortcuts supported: `1`, `5`, `10`, `20`

