## 🖥️ GUI (`/lifesteal`)

### Heart Bar (Row 1)
- 🟥 Red glass panes = current hearts filled
- ⬛ Black glass panes = empty hearts
- Scales proportionally to your max heart count

### Stats Panel (Row 2)
| Slot | Item | Shows |
|---|---|---|
| Left | Nether Star | Current hearts, max hearts, how many you can withdraw |
| Middle | Diamond Sword | PvP kills, deaths, hearts stolen from others |
| Centre | Hopper | Withdraw button — click to withdraw 1 heart instantly |
| Right | Book | Top 5 leaderboard by heart count with medals 🥇🥈🥉 |

