## 📁 Config Overview (`config.yml`)

```yaml
starting-hearts: 10        # Hearts on first join
max-hearts: 20             # Maximum hearts a player can reach
withdraw-min-keep: 2       # Minimum hearts you must keep (can't withdraw below this)
hearts-per-kill: 1         # Hearts stolen per PvP kill
hearts-lost-on-death: 1    # Hearts lost on any death
respawn-floor-hearts: 9    # Hearts given when player hits 0
heart-item-model-data: 1001 # Custom model data for resource packs
broadcast-kills: true      # Broadcast heart steals server-wide
autosave-interval: 5       # Minutes between auto-saves
```

All messages are fully configurable under the `messages:` section.

