## 💾 Data Storage
- Player data saved to `plugins/NexoraLifesteal/players.yml`
- Stores per player: hearts, kills, deaths, hearts stolen
- Saves on quit, saves every 5 minutes automatically
- All file I/O is **async** — no TPS impact

