## 🔧 Technical Notes
- Uses **Paper AttributeModifier** with `NamespacedKey` for max health changes — no deprecated methods
- Heart items identified by **PersistentDataContainer tag**, never by display name
- Heart cap and minimum enforced on both withdraw and deposit
- `/sethearts` clamps to configured min/max automatically
- Handles `/reload` safely — re-applies hearts to all online players on enable

